@startuml daily-loop
!include _style.puml
title Fuel Factor — 2. The daily loop

start
:Open app -> Today\nfuel ring · streak · six meal slots;

repeat
  :Tap a meal slot\nbreakfast · pre-training · lunch\npost-training · dinner · evening snack;
  :Search the Indonesian food DB\nnasi · pisang · mie ayam · ubi jalar;
  :Pick a portion\n1 bowl / 200 g / 1 medium;
  :Macros added\n(see 03-advice-engine); <<fuel>>
  :Fuel ring animates to the new value;
repeat while (More slots left today?) is (yes) not (no)

:Evening check-in\nsleep hrs · fruit/veg/protein/carbs counts\nfluid mL · urine 1-8 · five 1-10 scales\nsupplements · notes;

note right
  Every field here is a column of
  the DAILY LOG or RECALL sheet.
  Fluid and the five scales are the
  two the current dataset is missing
  entirely.
end note

:Score the day — DQ score /12\n6 slots + 4 counters + fluid + urine;

if (Check-in submitted?) then (yes)
  :Streak +1\nhaptic + flame pop; <<go>>
else (no)
  :Streak at risk\nbroken at midnight; <<alert>>
endif

note left
  The streak increments on the
  CHECK-IN, not on a logged meal.
  Otherwise it rewards opening
  the app, not finishing the day.
end note

:Show up to three advice cards;
stop
@enduml
